# .fah holds local-only junk (bash_jobs, sessions, logs, scratch) — but a
# curated subset is committed on purpose: the project config (and
# rules/lsp/mcp/agents/skills/packages when they appear). The memory/ dir
# at the repo root is the committed agent memory (see .fah/config.yaml and
# the "Agent Memory" section in AGENTS.md).
.fah/*
!.fah/config.yaml
!.fah/rules.yaml
!.fah/lsp.json
!.fah/mcp.json
!.fah/agents/
!.fah/skills/
!.fah/packages.yaml
